{"content_hash": "c65eebc1e59c4aa2", "version_id": 853, "article_id": 86, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Apple's AirPods 5 brings noise cancelling to the cheaper model", "title_zh": "苹果 AirPods 5 把降噪下放到便宜版本", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/118122", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1662946834880-99adabd21f80?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NHx8dGRzJTIwcmV2aWV3JTIwYXBwbGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzY3NDkzM3ww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by BoliviaInteligente on Unsplash", "author": "BoliviaInteligente", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@boliviainteligente?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/apple-logo-in-glass-cube-fN4YeoA14OI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(104, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(142, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "a388a2c1c56a"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-03", "word_count": 202, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "Apple has released the AirPods 5, and its biggest change is that cheaper versions now get active noise cancelling. However, the design is the same as before and battery life has not improved much.", "lead_zh": "苹果发布了 AirPods 5，最大变化是便宜版本也用上了主动降噪。不过外观和上一代一样，续航也没怎么提升。", "preview": "The AirPods 5 looks almost the same as the AirPods 4, because it still comes only in white and uses the same small case. Although the outsid", "preview_zh": "AirPods 5 的外观几乎和 AirPods 4 一样，仍然只有白色，充电盒也还是那么小。虽然外面没变，苹果说内部结构重新做了，用来改善气流。一个真正的升级是防水：耳机和充电盒现在都达到 IP57 标准。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 836, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/86/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 75.825, "size_bytes": 455904, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 226, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0cb59f2/content/data/versions/853.json", "paragraphs": ["The AirPods 5 looks almost the same as the AirPods 4, because it still comes only in white and uses the same small case. Although the outside has not changed, Apple says it rebuilt the inside to improve airflow. One real upgrade is water protection: both the earbuds and the case now meet the IP57 standard.", "The cheaper 999 yuan model loses some useful features, because it has no speaker or wireless charging in the case. You must pay 1149 yuan to get wireless charging and precise finding. The earbuds still respond well to presses, and the new swipe control only works on the more expensive version.", "Noise cancelling is the strongest part, since the AirPods 5 cuts low sounds far better than the AirPods 4 ANC. It also adjusts quickly when the earbuds move, although wind noise on calls still needs work. Transparency mode stays natural, so talking to people is easy.", "The default sound is thick and bass-heavy, which suits hip-hop and dance music but hurts overall balance. Battery life reached 4 hours 44 minutes in one test, slightly above Apple's claim. For now, the AirPods 5 and AirPods 4 ANC remain the best half-in-ear noise-cancelling earbuds you can buy."], "paragraphs_zh": ["AirPods 5 的外观几乎和 AirPods 4 一样，仍然只有白色，充电盒也还是那么小。虽然外面没变，苹果说内部结构重新做了，用来改善气流。一个真正的升级是防水：耳机和充电盒现在都达到 IP57 标准。", "999 元的便宜版本少了一些实用功能，因为充电盒里没有扬声器，也不支持无线充电。想要无线充电和精确查找，得花 1149 元买贵的那款。耳机按压反应依然灵敏，但新的滑动控制只有贵的那款才有。", "降噪是最强的地方，AirPods 5 对低频噪音的压制比 AirPods 4 ANC 好很多。耳机移动时它也能很快调整，不过通话时的风噪还需要改进。通透模式依然自然，和人说话很方便。", "默认声音偏厚、低频偏多，适合嘻哈和舞曲，但整体平衡受影响。一次测试中续航达到 4 小时 44 分钟，略高于苹果的说法。目前 AirPods 5 和 AirPods 4 ANC 仍是最好的半入耳降噪耳机。"], "body": "The AirPods 5 looks almost the same as the AirPods 4, because it still comes only in white and uses the same small case. Although the outside has not changed, Apple says it rebuilt the inside to improve airflow. One real upgrade is water protection: both the earbuds and the case now meet the IP57 standard.\n\nThe cheaper 999 yuan model loses some useful features, because it has no speaker or wireless charging in the case. You must pay 1149 yuan to get wireless charging and precise finding. The earbuds still respond well to presses, and the new swipe control only works on the more expensive version.\n\nNoise cancelling is the strongest part, since the AirPods 5 cuts low sounds far better than the AirPods 4 ANC. It also adjusts quickly when the earbuds move, although wind noise on calls still needs work. Transparency mode stays natural, so talking to people is easy.\n\nThe default sound is thick and bass-heavy, which suits hip-hop and dance music but hurts overall balance. Battery life reached 4 hours 44 minutes in one test, slightly above Apple's claim. For now, the AirPods 5 and AirPods 4 ANC remain the best half-in-ear noise-cancelling earbuds you can buy.", "body_zh": "AirPods 5 的外观几乎和 AirPods 4 一样，仍然只有白色，充电盒也还是那么小。虽然外面没变，苹果说内部结构重新做了，用来改善气流。一个真正的升级是防水：耳机和充电盒现在都达到 IP57 标准。\n\n999 元的便宜版本少了一些实用功能，因为充电盒里没有扬声器，也不支持无线充电。想要无线充电和精确查找，得花 1149 元买贵的那款。耳机按压反应依然灵敏，但新的滑动控制只有贵的那款才有。\n\n降噪是最强的地方，AirPods 5 对低频噪音的压制比 AirPods 4 ANC 好很多。耳机移动时它也能很快调整，不过通话时的风噪还需要改进。通透模式依然自然，和人说话很方便。\n\n默认声音偏厚、低频偏多，适合嘻哈和舞曲，但整体平衡受影响。一次测试中续航达到 4 小时 44 分钟，略高于苹果的说法。目前 AirPods 5 和 AirPods 4 ANC 仍是最好的半入耳降噪耳机。", "text": "The AirPods 5 looks almost the same as the AirPods 4, because it still comes only in white and uses the same small case. Although the outside has not changed, Apple says it rebuilt the inside to improve airflow. One real upgrade is water protection: both the earbuds and the case now meet the IP57 standard. The cheaper 999 yuan model loses some useful features, because it has no speaker or wireless charging in the case. You must pay 1149 yuan to get wireless charging and precise finding. The earbuds still respond well to presses, and the new swipe control only works on the more expensive version. Noise cancelling is the strongest part, since the AirPods 5 cuts low sounds far better than the AirPods 4 ANC. It also adjusts quickly when the earbuds move, although wind noise on calls still needs work. Transparency mode stays natural, so talking to people is easy. The default sound is thick and bass-heavy, which suits hip-hop and dance music but hurts overall balance. Battery life reached 4 hours 44 minutes in one test, slightly above Apple's claim. For now, the AirPods 5 and AirPods 4 ANC remain the best half-in-ear noise-cancelling earbuds you can buy.", "vocab": [{"word": "noise cancelling", "pos": "noun", "zh": "降噪", "note": "常作定语：noise-cancelling earbuds", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "upgrade", "pos": "noun", "zh": "升级", "note": "动词、名词同形", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "standard", "pos": "noun", "zh": "标准", "note": "meet the standard 达到标准", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feature", "pos": "noun", "zh": "功能", "note": "复数 features 常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wireless charging", "pos": "noun", "zh": "无线充电", "note": "charge 是动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "precise", "pos": "adj", "zh": "精确的", "note": "副词 precisely", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "adjust", "pos": "verb", "zh": "调整", "note": "adjust to 适应", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bass-heavy", "pos": "adj", "zh": "低频偏多的", "note": "描述声音常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "balance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "平衡", "note": "声音的平衡感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "slightly", "pos": "adv", "zh": "略微", "note": "比 a little 正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-03T03:02:11.555592", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "AirPods", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.85, "sm": 375, "em": 850, "cs": 4, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "5", "s": 0.85, "e": 1.2, "sm": 850, "em": 1200, "cs": 12, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "looks", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.45, "sm": 1200, "em": 1450, "cs": 14, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "almost", "s":